# Overflow (reference/common/overflow.md): page of 200 × 300 with margins of 20, page area of 160 × 260 from (20, 20).
# One box after the other in block flow; the Rects are those of the declared sizes, which Overflow: shrink does not
# change (it reduces the Size of the text until it fits them).
#   shrink:   a Text with Width 120 and Height 14 whose text does not fit in one line at Size 10: the text is reduced
#             until it fits the width in one line of at most 14. Rect 20 20 120 14.
#   table:    a Table of 50 + 110 with For element: Cell giving Height 16 and Overflow: shrink. "Cliente" fits at Size
#             10 and is not reduced; the second cell is. Rect 20 34 160 16; c1 20 34 50 16; c2 70 34 110 16.
#   absolute: a Text with Line height 12 (points, not a percentage), Width 100 and Height 24: three lines at Size 10
#             do not fit in 24, and the text is reduced until it has two, which keep the line height of 12.
#             Rect 20 50 100 24.
#   clip:     a Frame of 120 × 50 with Overflow: clip, a background and two boxes that stick out of it, painted clipped
#             by its padding box: band, in flow, 160 wide (Rect 20 74 160 10), and badge, an Overlay with Offset
#             20 auto auto 90 of 60 × 60 (Rect 110 94 60 60), which sticks out on the right and at the bottom.
#             Rect 20 74 120 50.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 200
		Height: 300
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
		For element: Cell
			Box:
				Height: 16
				Overflow: shrink
	Section:
		Text: Nombre de cliente especialmente largo
			Id: shrink
			Box:
				Width: 120
				Height: 14
				Border: 0 0 1 0
				Overflow: shrink
		Table:
			Id: table
			Column sizes: 50 110
			Body:
				Row:
					Cell: Cliente
						Id: c1
					Cell: Transportes del Mediterráneo S.L.
						Id: c2
		Text: Un texto que se encoge hasta caber en dos líneas
			Id: absolute
			Box:
				Width: 100
				Height: 24
				Overflow: shrink
			Typography:
				Line height: 12
		Frame:
			Id: clip
			Box:
				Width: 120
				Height: 50
				Background: #EEF2F7
				Overflow: clip
			Block:
				Id: band
				Box:
					Width: 160
					Height: 10
					Background: #1F3A5F
			Overlay:
				Id: badge
				Offset: 20 auto auto 90
				Box:
					Width: 60
					Height: 60
					Corner radius: 50%
					Background: #C8102E
